      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4680238853722287462, guid: 053124d1e88fbb64bb05cf4e94329496, type: 3}
      propertyPath: globalMessage.messages.Array.data[1]
      value: 'They''re a bit of a remnant of the stealth survival

        original
        concept. But I''''ve grown quite attached.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4680238853722287462, guid: 053124d1e88fbb64bb05cf4e94329496, type: 3}
      propertyPath: globalMessage.messages.Array.data[2]
      value: 'I know I want status effects, and I want

        benefits to taking
        care of these girls, but...'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4680238853722287462, guid: 053124d1e88fbb64bb05cf4e94329496, type: 3}
      propertyPath: globalMessage.messages.Array.data[3]
      value: 'The question is, how do these systems interplay

        in a way that''s
        simple to understand and rewarding?'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
